  "name": "Summoner's Tactics",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You and your eidolon have a dedicated way to complement each other’s style of combat and your skill as a conjurer. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.bCLBiXDx5A3UmVNE]{Manifesting Touch} free action, which allows you to more readily call for your Eidolon. You also gain your choice of either the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.HStu2Yhw3iQER9tY]{Boost Eidolon} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.TYbCj4dgXDOZou9k]{Reinforce Eidolon} link cantrips, and your choice of tactic grants you an additional class feat and link spell.</p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.Item.Vk8iFqBSRndWATwX]{Riftcaller}</p></li><li><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.Item.0u82rcgcDJcxMUJO]{Synthesist}</p></li></ul>"
